 </figure>
 
 </div>
 
 
</div></div></div><div class="col sqs-col-6 span-6"><div class="sqs-block spacer-block sqs-block-spacer" data-aspect-ratio=3.8194444444444446 data-block-type=21 id=block-yui_3_17_2_1_1644086999318_10094><div class="sqs-block-content sqs-intrinsic" id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_281 style=padding-bottom:3.81944%>&nbsp;</div></div><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type=2 id=block-c5276ad96a251e932511><div class=sqs-block-content>
<h2 style=text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap>Our Solution</h2><p class=sqsrte-large style=white-space:pre-wrap>REEcycle’s proven recycling process can recover nearly all REEs locked inside of discarded NdFeB magnets. <p style=white-space:pre-wrap>With our low waste recycling process, REEcycle aims to provide an alternative option to electronic waste as well as reduce supply uncertainty for companies reliant on rare earth elements.<p style=white-space:pre-wrap><span class=sqsrte-text-color--custom style=color:#47943F>✔</span> <strong>New revenue stream</strong> from electronic waste<p style=white-space:pre-wrap><span class=sqsrte-text-color--custom style=color:#47943F>✔</span> <strong>Dependable, renewable, secure source</strong> of REEs<p style=white-space:pre-wrap><span class=sqsrte-text-color--custom style=color:#47943F>✔</span> <strong>Source REEs domestically </strong>within the USA<p style=white-space:pre-wrap><span class=sqsrte-text-color--custom style=color:#47943F>✔</span> <strong>Reduce landfill waste </strong>and support sustainable end-of-life process<p style=white-space:pre-wrap><span class=sqsrte-text-color--custom style=color:#47943F>✔</span> <strong>Patented, low waste </strong>process<p style=white-space:pre-wrap><span class=sqsrte-text-color--custom style=color:#47943F>✔</span> <strong>Truly circular and sustainable </strong>product<p style=white-space:pre-wrap><span class=sqsrte-text-color--custom style=color:#47943F>✔</span> <strong>Very low </strong>carbon footprint process</p>
</div></div><div class="sqs-block button-block sqs-block-button" data-block-type=53 id=block-yui_3_17_2_1_1659366275557_18114><div class=sqs-block-content id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_269>
<div class="sqs-block-button-container sqs-block-button-container--left" data-animation-role=button data-alignment=left data-button-size=medium data-button-type=primary id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_268>
 <a href=https://www.reecycleinc.com/contact class="sqs-block-button-element--medium sqs-button-element--primary sqs-block-button-element" data-initialized=true>
 REECYCLE TODAY
 </a>
</div>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
 </div>
 </div>
 
 
</section>
 
 
 
 
