 <div class="sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12" data-type=page-section id=page-section-61fecdf1b03f68283363ae8d><div class="row sqs-row" id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_159><div class="col sqs-col-12 span-12" id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_158><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type=2 id=block-5e6887fa0d8ddc5300f4><div class=sqs-block-content>
<h2 style=text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap>How It Works</h2><p style=text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap>Using a patented recycling process, REEcycle recovers rare earth elements that are essential for NdFeB magnets. These magnets come from cutting edge electronics and innovative clean energy technologies. With our low-cost, low waste recycling process, we are creating a new source of rare earth supply with the same sustainable focus of the technologies they make possible.</p>
</div></div><div class="row sqs-row" id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_157><div class="col sqs-col-4 span-4" id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_156><div class="sqs-block spacer-block sqs-block-spacer sized vsize-1" data-block-type=21 id=block-1819ffb0785f90f6aa31><div class=sqs-block-content>&nbsp;</div></div><div class="sqs-block image-block sqs-block-image sqs-text-ready" data-block-type=5 id=block-d6862c2d0361d47ffc63><div class=sqs-block-content id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_155>
 
 
 
 <div class="image-block-outer-wrapper layout-caption-hidden design-layout-inline combination-animation-none individual-animation-none individual-text-animation-none sqs-narrow-width" data-test=image-block-inline-outer-wrapper id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_154>
 
 
 <figure class="sqs-block-image-figure intrinsic" style=max-width:1080px id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_153>
 
 
 
 
 
 
 <div class=image-block-wrapper data-animation-role=image id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_152>
 <div class=sqs-image-shape-container-element style=position:relative;padding-bottom:80.9259262084961%;overflow:hidden id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_151>
 
 <noscript><img src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/61fec00301ec5b7bb87bc7e1/d7b5872d-fc6c-4f60-98b0-8980c75b1e94/how-it-works-sourcing.png" alt=""></noscript><img class="thumb-image loaded" data-src=https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/61fec00301ec5b7bb87bc7e1/d7b5872d-fc6c-4f60-98b0-8980c75b1e94/how-it-works-sourcing.png data-image=https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/61fec00301ec5b7bb87bc7e1/d7b5872d-fc6c-4f60-98b0-8980c75b1e94/how-it-works-sourcing.png data-image-dimensions=1080x874 data-image-focal-point=0.5,0.5 alt data-load=false data-image-id=62146e602232e054c34803fb data-type=image data-image-resolution=500w src="data:image/png;base64,">
 
 </div>
 </div>
 
 
 
 
 
 </figure>
 
 </div>
 
 
</div></div><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type=2 id=block-5cdc8e47407b18d7bcac><div class=sqs-block-content>
<h4 style=text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap><span class=sqsrte-text-color--accent>SOURCING</span></h4><p style=text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap>We start with discarded magnets from electronic waste such as  hard disk drives, wind turbine motors , electronic vehicle and bike motors, speakers, MRI machines, satellite communications, and national defense systems.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="col sqs-col-4 span-4" id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_180><div class="sqs-block image-block sqs-block-image sqs-text-ready" data-block-type=5 id=block-2715fb919ddf1ea240c2><div class=sqs-block-content id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_179>
 
 
 
 <div class="image-block-outer-wrapper layout-caption-hidden design-layout-inline combination-animation-none individual-animation-none individual-text-animation-none sqs-narrow-width" data-test=image-block-inline-outer-wrapper id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_178>
 
 
 <figure class="sqs-block-image-figure intrinsic" style=max-width:1080px id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_177>
 
 
 
 
 
 
 <div class=image-block-wrapper data-animation-role=image id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_176>
 <div class=sqs-image-shape-container-element style=position:relative;padding-bottom:80.9259262084961%;overflow:hidden id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_175>
 
 <noscript><img src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/61fec00301ec5b7bb87bc7e1/cf2d62a6-e64a-4f1a-b859-4ac14b165885/how-it-works-technology.png" alt=""></noscript><img class="thumb-image loaded" data-src=https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/61fec00301ec5b7bb87bc7e1/cf2d62a6-e64a-4f1a-b859-4ac14b165885/how-it-works-technology.png data-image=https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/61fec00301ec5b7bb87bc7e1/cf2d62a6-e64a-4f1a-b859-4ac14b165885/how-it-works-technology.png data-image-dimensions=1080x874 data-image-focal-point=0.5,0.5 alt data-load=false data-image-id=62146e700a711978e9df0da7 data-type=image data-image-resolution=500w src="data:image/png;base64,">
 
 </div>
 </div>
 
 
 
 
 
 </figure>
 
 </div>
 
 
</div></div><div class="sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html" data-block-type=2 id=block-150ba08150cd774c60e4><div class=sqs-block-content>
<h4 style=text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap><span class=sqsrte-text-color--accent>TECHNOLOGY</span></h4><p style=text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap>With a 99.8% recover efficiency,<strong> </strong>our process extracts rare earths in the form of metal organic frameworks (MOFs). The process requires low temperatures and the solvents are consumed in the process, minimizing energy needs and waste.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="col sqs-col-4 span-4" id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_198><div class="sqs-block spacer-block sqs-block-spacer sized vsize-1" data-block-type=21 id=block-4c64984d35da961ed330><div class=sqs-block-content>&nbsp;</div></div><div class="sqs-block image-block sqs-block-image sqs-text-ready" data-block-type=5 id=block-63f9a59db63e6619204c><div class=sqs-block-content id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_197>
 
 
 
 <div class="image-block-outer-wrapper layout-caption-hidden design-layout-inline combination-animation-none individual-animation-none individual-text-animation-none sqs-narrow-width" data-test=image-block-inline-outer-wrapper id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_196>
 
 
 <figure class="sqs-block-image-figure intrinsic" style=max-width:1080px id=yui_3_17_2_1_1676812587832_195>
 
 
 
 
 
 
