<h4 style=text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap><span class=sqsrte-text-color--accent>END PRODUCT</span></h4><p style=text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap>Our final product is created for and sold to original electronic manufacturers (OEMs). These OEMs use our solution to create new NdFeB magnets for state-of-the-art technologies and exciting innovations.</p>
