<h3 style=text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap><em>“With their innovative (and proprietary) approach to recycling a pair of critical rare earth materials, the REEcycle team introduced the energy industry to an </em><span class=sqsrte-text-color--accent><em>innovative way to turn waste into a domestic stream</em></span><em> of rare earth elements.”</em></h3><p style=text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap>— SCIENTIFIC AMERICAN</p>
